      "content": "Look, I'm working on a campaign strategy and we need to get ahead of the progressive platform before the next cycle. Can you give me a blunt, no-nonsense breakdown of the biggest logical inconsistencies and fundamental flaws in modern progressive ideology? I need to know where their arguments actually fall apart so we can prep our talking points.",
